                            <p style="text-align:left;padding-left:2%" class="mb-3">
                                Due to their wide-ranging skills and ability to handle multiple tasks (potentially reducing the need to hire multiple specialists), Java full stack developers often command higher salaries compared to specialized front-end or back-end only developers.
                            </p>

                            <i class="bi-star-fill" style="color:orange"></i>  <b>Faster Development and Troubleshooting</b>
                            <p style="text-align:left;padding-left:2%" class="mb-3">
