                            </p>

                            <i class="bi-star-fill" style="color:orange"></i> <b>Strong Career Growth Potential</b>
                            <p style="text-align:left;padding-left:2%" class="mb-3">
                                The broad experience gained from working across the entire stack provides a solid foundation for career progression into leadership roles such as technical lead, software architect, or project manager.
                            </p>

                            <i class="bi-star-fill" style="color:orange"></i> <b>Adaptability to New Technologies</b>
